<mxfile><diagram id="diff" name="diff"><mxGraphModel grid="0" page="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="notes" value="WF-02 Demo scenarios: 45 thay đổi. Xanh lá = thêm · Đỏ = xoá · Vàng cam = đổi; phần còn lại làm mờ.&lt;br&gt;• Thêm activity “Hand over the samples”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Record receipt → Record receipt, time, amount and storage&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Print label → Print label and hand accepted samples to departments&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Sign handover record → Confirm actual samples and sign the record&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Scan label → Scan the label to record department receipt&lt;br&gt;• Xoá system activity “Queue testing task”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm activity “Adjust expected samples and record differences”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-02a Main: sample received in good condition → DS-02a Main: sample received in good condition ↔ WF-02 main path&lt;br&gt;• Đổi lane: System → Head of department&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Sample received, task queued → Testing tasks in department queues → WF-03 Testing assignment and scheduling&lt;br&gt;• Đổi lane: System → Head of department&lt;br&gt;• Đổi lane: Sample delivery staff → Customer&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Paid request, 1 expected sample → Paid request, customer brings 1 sample&lt;br&gt;• Đổi lane: Sample delivery staff → Customer&lt;br&gt;• Thêm notification “✉ Remind staff”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Hold sample → Put on hold&lt;br&gt;• Đổi hình: system activity system activity “Hold sample” → activity&lt;br&gt;• Đổi lane: System → Sample delivery staff&lt;br&gt;• Xoá system activity “Queue testing tasks”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm activity “Claim the collection task and plan its time”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-02b Sample arrives insufficient → DS-02b Sample arrives insufficient ↔ WF-02-E1&lt;br&gt;• Đổi lane: System → Sample delivery staff&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Sample received, tasks queued → Sample back to received&lt;br&gt;• Đổi lane: System → Sample delivery staff&lt;br&gt;• Xoá system activity “Queue testing tasks”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-02c One of two samples unusable → DS-02c One of two samples unusable ↔ WF-02 unusable sample&lt;br&gt;• Đổi lane: System → Sample delivery staff&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: One rejected, one goes to testing → One rejected, one received&lt;br&gt;• Đổi lane: System → Sample delivery staff&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-02d Handover record has wrong quantity → DS-02d Handover record has wrong quantity ↔ WF-02-E2&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: ● initial node “Paid request, 1 expected sample” → activity “Record receipt” → ● initial node “Paid request, customer brings 1 sample” → activity “Hand over the samples”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: system activity “Create collection task” → activity “Collect sample” → system activity “Create collection task” → activity “Claim the collection task and plan its time”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Record receipt” → system activity “Queue testing tasks” → activity “Record receipt” → ◉ activity final “Sample back to received”&lt;br&gt;• Xoá system activity “Queue testing tasks” → ◉ activity final “Sample received, tasks queued”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Record receipt” → activity “Print label” → activity “Record receipt, time, amount and storage” → activity “Confirm actual samples and sign the record”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Record good sample” → system activity “Queue testing tasks” → activity “Record good sample” → ◉ activity final “One rejected, one received”&lt;br&gt;• Xoá system activity “Queue testing tasks” → ◉ activity final “One rejected, one goes to testing”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm activity “Hand over the samples” → activity “Adjust expected samples and record differences”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm activity “Adjust expected samples and record differences” → activity “Record receipt, time, amount and storage”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm activity “Claim the collection task and plan its time” → notification “✉ Remind staff”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Print label” → activity “Sign handover record” → activity “Print label and hand accepted samples to departments” → activity “Scan the label to record department receipt”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm notification “✉ Remind staff” → activity “Collect sample”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: notification “✉ Email handover PDF” → activity “Scan label” → notification “✉ Email handover PDF” → activity “Print label and hand accepted samples to departments”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Scan label” → system activity “Queue testing task” → activity “Scan the label to record department receipt” → ◉ activity final “Testing tasks in department queues → WF-03 Testing assignment and scheduling”&lt;br&gt;• Xoá system activity “Queue testing task” → ◉ activity final “Sample received, task queued”" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=17;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="3020" height="1212" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cap_l" value="Trước" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1240" width="1470" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cap_r" value="Sau" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry x="1570" y="1240" width="1470" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l_ds02_lane_cus" value="Customer" style="swimlane;startSize=40;container=0;collapsible=0;fillColor=#F3F4F6;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#9CA3AF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1272" width="300" height="1720" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l_ds02_lane_stf" value="Sample delivery staff" style="swimlane;startSize=40;container=0;collapsible=0;fillColor=#F3F4F6;swimlaneFillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#9CA3AF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mx